/Title (The Pharmacy Management System \(PMS\) is a centralized relational database platform engineered to streamline and digitize pharmaceutical retail and inventory operations. Modern healthcare management demands seamless trace-ability of drugs, strict adherence to expiration mandates, efficient billing, precise prescription tracking, and robust supplier logistics. Traditional paper-based or file-based management systems lead to data redundancy, stockouts, expired medication risks, and delayed billing customer experiences.)
